<p>A possible example suggested by georage:
</p>
<pre>To create a quasi-heartbeat, create a script called 'my_heartbeat' and include this in it

DelayEvent(6.0, GetHero(), Event(EVENT_TYPE_HEARTBEAT), "my_heartbeat");

Detailed example: <a rel="nofollow" class="external autonumber" href="http://social.bioware.com/forum/1/topic/71/index/310150/1#402992">[1]</a>
</pre>
<p>However the quality of scripting and document must be improved before it would be an appropriate reference. Additionally reference pages must not reference external resources which cannot be maintained by the editors.
